abstract: Source code for buoyant plume and stratification simulations developed for Arij Asad's PhD
  research, Mixing behaviour of plumes, at the University of Bristol. The package covers two-dimensional
  Cartesian, two-dimensional axisymmetric and three-dimensional rectangular configurations. It contains
  legacy FEniCS solvers, cluster launchers, restart utilities, numerical checks, and Python and MATLAB
  post-processing.
